  "body": "**Suggestion**\r\nWhat would you like to see in Matrix? If your idea is vaguely complete enough, we\r\nrecommend submitting [an MSC](https://matrix.org/docs/spec/proposals) instead.\r\n\r\nThe timeout function should place an user on a 'timeout' when they're unable to speak (muted) for a specific period of time.\r\nWe could think of it as a 'temporary mute'. Users with a power level equal or higher to 50 (Moderator) should be able to do this.\r\n\r\nWe may also want to timeout a user on just a specific room or on an entire space.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, we want to show the muted user a message that states that they were muted with the reason and time left included, and the inability to add reactions to posts.",
